  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tea Production Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to help the group rehabilitate unused plantations, improve its infrastructure, establish a modern tea nursery, transport tea to market, improve its financial management capacity, as well as improve on the technical capacity of its members.</narrative>
  </description>
